    "embedded_authority": "All runtime mappings and callbacks use the embedded Script stream from the exact retained table. It registers output 14 to solURFlipper, output 19 to solGoblin, the trough/motor/VUK callbacks, and SolModCallback flashers 21/23/25-31; it uses Const UseSolenoids = 1.",
